 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (6): ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans, You Cannot Hide Forever & Mobilization Points, Wipe Them Out, All Of Them, Coruscant; these count toward the 60.",
  "Total 64 as published: the Characters header says 20 but 22 cards are listed, and the Locations header says 5 but 6 are listed.",
  "Posted 'Naboo Main Core Shaft (Ref III card)' dested the Reflections III site Naboo: Theed Palace Generator Core (Dark); the strategy calls it 'the 3-2 location' for Buzzsaw. Reflections III came out on 31 October 2001, after this post, so the format is Premiere - Reflections III.",
  "Cards posted with '(ISB)' (Corporal Derdram, Officer Evax, Lt. Pol Treidum, Corporal Vandolay, Probe Droid x2, Outer Rim Scout) dested the printed cards; '(ISB)' marks them as ISB agents, not virtual versions. 'Tarkin(ISB)' dested Tarkin (Jedi Pack), the only printed card named Tarkin at the time.",
  "Posted 'Cyler(ISB)' matches no card; it is printed as posted.",
  "Posted 'IBS Ops' dested ISB Operations; 'Grand Admiral Trawn' dested Grand Admiral Thrawn; 'Mara Jade, TEH' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Chimera' dested Chimaera; 'Neimiodian Advisor' dested Neimoidian Advisor; 'SFS 9.3 Laser Canon' dested SFS L-s9.3 Laser Cannons.",
  "Coruscant dested the Dark Special Edition system; Alter dested the Dark Premiere Interrupt; the Naboo system and the Theed Palace Courtyard, Docking Bay and Throne Room dested the Dark Coruscant cards.",
  "Posted 'Vader's Stick', 'Mara Jade's Stick' and 'Maul's Stick' dested Vader's Lightsaber, Mara Jade's Lightsaber and Maul's Lightsaber (Tatooine)."
 ],
